research/
*.png
*.log
shots/

.vercel

# Downloaded source documents, public and private. Never committed - see corpus/README.md.
# Ignore the CONTENTS, not the directory: git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded
# directory, so `corpus/` plus a negation would hide the README too.
corpus/*
!corpus/README.md
# Cards are the exception, and deliberately so. A card holds no file body - it is the
# boundary object the design rests on (Claude Enterprise writes it, Groq only ever reads it),
# so it must be reviewable in a diff. Ignoring it lost 7 cards to one untracked directory.
!corpus/cards/
